test/check/error-projections.sumspec:11:25:
   |
11 | __init :: App(Page.Home(Status.Up))
   |                         ^
projection Status is read from the base's state, so __init doesn't set it; leave it out

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:21:1:
   |
21 | Status __from core.Core(core.Link)
   | ^
projection Status has no variant Down; it has every variant of core.Link

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:23:5:
   |
23 |   | Sideways
   |     ^
Sideways is not a variant of core.Link

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:26:37:
   |
26 | Row __from core.Todo = core.Title * core.Link
   |                                     ^
core.Link is not a part of core.Todo; a projection shows its source's parts, or projections of them

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:27:26:
   |
27 | Wrong __from core.Core = core.Title
   |                          ^
core.Title is not a part of core.Core; a projection shows its source's parts, or projections of them

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:29:37:
   |
29 | Chain __from core.Core(core.Todos * core.Link) = core.Link
   |                                     ^
each type in a __from path holds one, the next type

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:30:36:
   |
30 | Variant __from core.Core(core.Link.Up) = core.Link
   |                                    ^
a __from path names types only, each holding the next; not a variant

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:31:14:
   |
31 | Local __from Page = Page
   |              ^
Page is not a type of a base spec; a projection reads a base's state

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:32:16:
   |
32 | NotRoot __from core.Todo = core.Title
   |                ^
projection NotRoot isn't inside another projection, so it reads from the base's root; start its path with core.Core

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:33:26:
   |
33 | Missing __from core.Core(core.Title) = core.Title
   |                          ^
core.Title is not a factor of core.Core

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:34:50:
   |
34 | Extra2 __from core.Core(core.Link) = Up | Down | Left
   |                                                  ^
Left is not a variant of core.Link

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:35:1:
   |
35 | Keyed __from core.Core(core.Todos) = [Row by core.Title]
   | ^
projection Keyed is keyed by core.Title, but core.Todos is keyed by core.TodoId

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:36:41:
   |
36 | Element __from core.Core(core.Todos) = [core.Title by core.TodoId]
   |                                         ^
core.Title is not core.Todo; a projection shows its source's parts, or projections of them

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:38:41:
   |
38 | set :: App(Page.Other) -> App(Page.Home(Status.Up))
   |                                         ^
projection Status is read from the base's state, so a target doesn't set it; leave it out

test/check/error-projections.sumspec:39:31:
   |
39 | reset :: Page.Home => Rows -> Rows'
   |                               ^
projection Rows is read from the base's state, so a target doesn't set it; leave it out

